                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4f4db649-2504-3d12-8720-696b62d09de5",
                        "entry_id": "f547f5a0-a55c-30ba-a6f0-bf1a6e96eed9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "privat-docentship"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b12a0d33-70ad-4da1-bcc4-68131583d4d7",
                                "sense_id": "4f4db649-2504-3d12-8720-696b62d09de5",
                                "text": "Ви́дно бы́ло по его́ блаже́нному, сия́ющему лицу́, что е́сли бы О́льга Ива́новна раздели́ла с ним его́ ра́дость и торжество́, то он прости́л бы ей всё, и настоя́щее и бу́дущее, и всё бы забы́л, но она́ не понима́ла, что зна́чит прива́т-доценту́ра и о́бщая патоло́гия, к тому́ же боя́лась опозда́ть в теа́тр и ничего́ не сказа́ла.",
                                "translation": "It was plain from his radiant face that had Olga Ivanovna shared his joy and triumph he would have forgiven and forgotten everything. But “privat-docentship” and “general pathology” had no meaning for her, and, whafs more, she feared to be late for the theatre. She said nothing.",
                                "english": "It was plain from his radiant face that had Olga Ivanovna shared his joy and triumph he would have forgiven and forgotten everything. But “privat-docentship” and “general pathology” had no meaning for her, and, whafs more, she feared to be late for the theatre. She said nothing."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
